{"title":"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the smallest positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> such that the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/e/2ae399db189090f336f8ac21ebc4065d8105261c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19999N$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> ends in the four digits 2007. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The problem states that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/e/56e79ccf71fb5e9fa900985d30ff2cac92c0ffb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19999N \\equiv 2007 \\pmod{10000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"229\" height=\"18\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/7/ac74f7d3ad04c51cac0ed86b01e1e64ed7bce33c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20000N \\equiv 0\\pmod{10000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"206\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/7/9978927f2b9a3b2a8f4196682bfd2d0960711dc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 20000N - 19999N \\equiv 0 - 2007 \\equiv 7993 \\pmod{10000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"446\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>Thus, the smallest positive integer solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77c8d55254ef930f0af99e6f37d7075b08a0231.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7993$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST\">2007 Alabama ARML TST</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/